    description: "Found by the 2026-11-07 docstring staleness audit (dev 4f2feb451b): a reviewer flagged it and a default-REJECT verifier re-reproduced it on a fixture of its own (reports under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/staleness_audit_11072026/review, verify and blind). Corpus impact not measured. _solve_one_function(root, root, ...) (ddg_build.py:946-950) passes the module root as body; module is not in _STATEMENT_BLOCK_NODE_TYPES (:684-687), so the WI-sodoj branch (:653-658) fires. A 6-line app.py gives a file return span 1-7 whose names include identifiers from inside a function body. Impact only when a call edge targets a file pseudo-symbol (taint.py:4319), not tested. r19, v07."  # d017
